      "value": "Advanced quarry deposit loop:\n\nThis mines a small box around where you stand, switches tools, and deposits when inventory space is low.\nUse in a safe test world first.\n\nEdit these components:\nEDIT Empty Space: how many empty slots to keep.\nEDIT Mine Box: From and To relative coordinates.\nEDIT Tool Low: durability number in Mine Area.\nEDIT Chest Search: chest radius/type/move.\nEDIT Deposit: all or specific item.\n\nPut pickaxe, shovel, and axe in your hotbar. Put a chest within the search radius.",
